<p class="eyebrow">Fortress revival &middot; coordinator skill &middot; skill drafts &middot; version 27 &middot; 16 November 2026</p>
<h1>Held rule drafts, version 27</h1>
<p class="standfirst">Version 27. Four landed changes wait for the curator&rsquo;s reading, items 34 to 37, and three drafts wait for the curator&rsquo;s yes, drafts 38 to 40. Items 35 to 37 landed on 16 November: the boot now reads POSITIONS whole and searches FACTS and INDEX, one sentence left &ldquo;The standing goal&rdquo;, and the part on delegation names the script that switches the workers&rsquo; tier. The drafts change three passages of &ldquo;Talking to the curator&rdquo;.</p>
</header>

